o interfaces: fix linter complaints in WLAN model, 11a typo and wpa_pairwise labels
o interfaces: dhclient handles keywords case-insensitive so properly match all "media" invokes (reported by Alice-Sabrina-Ivy)
o interfaces: refactor interfaces_ppps_hardware() and avoid emitting serial device nodes
o interfaces: allow to push $all_plugins in interface_configure()
